WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:04.750
Hey everybody, I am genuinely glad that you
are with me today.

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:08.250
Uh, even the trolls, we're going to send me
really angry messages.

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:13.959
We have big news today in the category of
this might make Trump loses mind as I call

00:00:13.959 --> 00:00:14.959
it.

00:00:14.959 --> 00:00:19.070
Donald Trump's oldest son, Donald Trump jr
has been subpoenaed to testify by the Senate

00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:23.099
intelligence committee and it's important
to remember that Republicans control the Senate

00:00:23.099 --> 00:00:26.110
and therefore they control the Senate intelligence
committee.

00:00:26.110 --> 00:00:31.519
The Chairman of the Senate Intelligence Committee
is Republican Richard Burr, but it has actually

00:00:31.519 --> 00:00:36.289
been that committee, one of the few places
where there seems to be some sort of bipartisan

00:00:36.289 --> 00:00:39.290
logic and dealing with the, the fiasco that
is Donald Trump.

00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:44.540
And specifically the Senate Intelligence Committee
wants Donald Trump Jr to show up and under

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:48.860
oath to answer questions about what were obviously
lies.

00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:54.950
The last time he testified before the committee,
um, related to his involvement in the Trump

00:00:54.950 --> 00:00:59.690
tower Moscow deal, which ultimately didn't
end up going forward.

00:00:59.690 --> 00:01:04.750
And Donald Trump jr previously testified about
that issue.

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:05.750
And he lied.

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:09.909
I mean, he, he claimed that he had limited
knowledge about that project.

00:01:09.909 --> 00:01:11.770
He claimed that there was never really a plan.

00:01:11.770 --> 00:01:17.280
It was never really anything more than a notion
that Michael Cohen thought up and never really

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:20.590
touched a Donald Trump jr in any way.

00:01:20.590 --> 00:01:25.470
But unfortunately, since Donald Trump, jr
told those lies to the Senate Intel Committee,

00:01:25.470 --> 00:01:29.090
um, we've found out that jr was lying.

00:01:29.090 --> 00:01:34.159
There were significant plans for Trump tower
Moscow, a site had been selected, a builder

00:01:34.159 --> 00:01:37.939
had been selected, there were architectural
print plans.

00:01:37.939 --> 00:01:39.549
There were many meetings about it.

00:01:39.549 --> 00:01:45.780
And maybe most importantly, as it relates
to Trump, Trump Jr's involvement, uh, individually,

00:01:45.780 --> 00:01:50.520
we heard from Donald Trump's former attorney,
Michael Cohen, who's now in prison, um, that

00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:57.810
he was personally briefing both Donald Trump
jr and Ivanka Trump, uh, and others about

00:01:57.810 --> 00:02:00.310
this Trump tower Moscow project.

00:02:00.310 --> 00:02:04.259
And he talked about it happening at least,
or roughly 10 times.

00:02:04.259 --> 00:02:09.980
Here's just like a few seconds from that testimony
under questioning from congressman, Steven

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:12.360
Lynch, with his delightful Boston accent

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:16.940
or the family members that you briefed on
the Trump tower Moscow project.

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:19.640
Don Trump jr and Ivanka Trump.

00:02:19.640 --> 00:02:20.640
Okay.

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:24.660
Now with these in the regular course of business,
or did the president or family request the

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:27.260
briefings, this is in the regular course of
business.

00:02:27.260 --> 00:02:30.650
Do you recall, um, there's a question on the
number of briefings.

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:32.410
Do you recall how many they might have been?

00:02:32.410 --> 00:02:33.430
I'm sorry, sir.

00:02:33.430 --> 00:02:36.560
Do you recall how many of these briefings
there might've been?

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:38.380
It's approximately 10.

00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:39.380
Okay.

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:40.380
In total.

00:02:40.380 --> 00:02:41.380
All right.

00:02:41.380 --> 00:02:42.380
All right.

00:02:42.380 --> 00:02:45.090
This is the opposite of what Donald Trump
Jr said under oath.

00:02:45.090 --> 00:02:49.720
And now the leaders of the Senate intelligence
committee who don't like being lied to, including

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:56.530
Republican Richard Burr ranking member, Democrat,
Mark Warner, they want Donald Trump jr to

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:57.530
show up again.

00:02:57.530 --> 00:03:04.300
Now, the fact that there is even a subpoena
is significant here because it implies that

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:09.850
Donald Trump jr already either ignored or
rejected, rejected a non subpoena request

00:03:09.850 --> 00:03:15.590
to appear, which arguably forced the committee
to issue the subpoena if they actually are

00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:18.460
determined to get them, uh, to answer questions
once again.

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:21.240
And so this is newsworthy for a few different
reasons.

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:27.610
One of those is that, again, this is a Republican
led committee and last night I was wondering

00:03:27.610 --> 00:03:34.800
is this going to cause infighting between
Trump and his administration and the Republicans

00:03:34.800 --> 00:03:38.320
in the Senate and it immediately has a source
close to Donald Trump.

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:47.530
Jr has said to CNBC that this is an obvious
PR stunt from a so called Republican senator.

00:03:47.530 --> 00:03:54.110
If you want the truth from Trump jr if you
don't want him lying you now, are apparently

00:03:54.110 --> 00:04:00.440
only a so called Republican according to individuals
close to Donald Trump jr.

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:02.830
So the infighting is starting right away.

00:04:02.830 --> 00:04:07.330
The expectation is that Trump junior is going
to fight the subpoena if possible and the

00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:10.890
funniest little game they're playing is the
following.

00:04:10.890 --> 00:04:18.410
CNBC is reporting that the person close to
Trump jr who is commenting about this says

00:04:18.410 --> 00:04:24.250
Don is a private citizen now who has already
been cleared by special counsel Robert Mueller

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:26.430
after a two year investigation.

00:04:26.430 --> 00:04:28.110
Are they really that dumb?

00:04:28.110 --> 00:04:30.520
Because there are endless other investigations.

00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:37.050
What I and others said, as soon as the Mueller
investigation up wrapped up was there are

00:04:37.050 --> 00:04:42.880
12 to 14 maybe even more depending on sort
of where the lines are between investigations.

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:45.400
There are more than a dozen other investigations.

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:46.440
This isn't the end.

00:04:46.440 --> 00:04:50.190
They're going to keep talking to witnesses
and a lot of people on the right said, David,

00:04:50.190 --> 00:04:52.090
come on, it's over.

00:04:52.090 --> 00:04:53.090
This is it.

00:04:53.090 --> 00:04:54.090
There's nothing else.

00:04:54.090 --> 00:04:58.390
And then now as we see, the Senate Intelligence
Committee wants Donald Trump junior back and

00:04:58.390 --> 00:05:01.840
the argument they're making is he's already
been cleared by Robert Mueller.

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:05.100
That's one of like 15 different investigations
that are going on.

00:05:05.100 --> 00:05:07.570
The Mueller probe was one thing.

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:12.800
Did they really think that it was all just
going to go away with the submission of the

00:05:12.800 --> 00:05:18.390
Mueller report or is this also a PR game that
they are playing more to curry favor with

00:05:18.390 --> 00:05:22.020
the public than to actually convince anybody
who's in a position of power?

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:28.460
I don't know, but the most important takeaway
here is for a Republican led committee to

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:33.720
subpoena the son of a Republican president
in the middle of all the chaos that's going

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:39.090
on now with the Mueller report with William
Barr, they must believe that Donald Trump

00:05:39.090 --> 00:05:40.780
jr lied to them.

00:05:40.780 --> 00:05:43.720
Senators don't like being lied to if there's
one.

00:05:43.720 --> 00:05:51.630
So if we think about like the different echelons
of priority among egotistical elected officials,

00:05:51.630 --> 00:05:56.790
very high on the list is uh, they don't like
their power questioned.

00:05:56.790 --> 00:06:00.800
Uh, and that is very much entangled with their
partisanship.

00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:03.870
They want to be loyal to their party.

00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:09.139
One of the things that will more quickly than
almost anything else get Democrats and Republicans

00:06:09.139 --> 00:06:13.790
United against some third party is if they
feel that their position of authority and

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:18.620
power has not been respected and showing up
and under oath lying to them, which is what

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:23.360
there was every indication Donald Trump jr
did, is a really quick way to get Republicans

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:24.900
and Democrats working together.

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:26.580
I hope that he shows up.

00:06:26.580 --> 00:06:29.220
If he fights the subpoena, we will report
it.

00:06:29.220 --> 00:06:55.470
And, uh, we will tell you what ultimately
happens

00:06:55.470 --> 00:07:37.370
with this.

